{"ID":"20230927143643-f1nh6xs","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927143643-f1nh6xs","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143643-f1nh6xs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143645-u5b6rx2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143645-8aqxx1a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927143645-8aqxx1a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:62,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:62\u0026#125;","title":"【天王补心丹】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927143645"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927143645-u5b6rx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143645-u5b6rx2","updated":"20230927143645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天王补心丹同名方约有九首，现选《校注妇人良方》卷六方。"}]},{"ID":"20230927143645-aeh2mta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143645-aeh2mta","updated":"20230927143645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：人参（去芦）、玄参、丹参、茯苓、远志、桔梗各五钱，生地黄四两，当归（酒浸）、五味、天门冬、麦门冬（去心）、柏子仁、酸枣仁（炒）各一两。上为末，炼蜜为丸，如梧桐子大，用朱砂为衣。每服二三十丸，临卧竹叶煎汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20230927143645-8aqxx1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927143645-8aqxx1a","updated":"20230927143645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该方据说是某个和尚每天晚上念经念到精神衰弱了，半夜梦到毗沙门天王传此方，所以这个方全名叫做‘毗沙门天王奉宣和尚神妙补心丸’；"}]}]}